21
00:01:07.372 --> 00:01:09.347
You were at a soccer game in Spain.

22
00:01:09.347 --> 00:01:10.571
Correct?
That's right.

23
00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:11.439
That's absolutely correct.

24
00:01:11.439 --> 00:01:13.258
This is where you got a sense of just how

25
00:01:13.258 --> 00:01:14.837
