26
00:01:14.837 --> 00:01:16.795
Overwhelmingly global, yeah.

27
00:01:16.795 --> 00:01:20.075
We were in Seville, filming in Seville in Spain.

28
00:01:20.075 --> 00:01:22.381
And we were very kindly invited along to

29
00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:24.719
