30
00:01:24.719 --> 00:01:27.343
one of the biggest games in the world.

31
00:01:27.343 --> 00:01:30.737
We were in the hospitality suite, which they had repainted.

32
00:01:30.737 --> 00:01:33.599
And they took some photographs, a little bit of video,

33
00:01:33.599 --> 00:01:35.316
before the match started.

34
00:01:35.316 --> 00:01:39.253
As the crowd filled up they said look who's in the house.

35
00:01:39.253 --> 00:01:42.351
They played the music, showed shots of us there,

36
00:01:42.351 --> 00:01:43.942
and then all of a sudden we heard,

37
00:01:43.942 --> 00:01:47.383
they played the title track, the theme song.

38
00:01:47.383 --> 00:01:49.810
The weirdest thing was hearing 80,000 people

39
00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:51.774
singing along at a football match.

40
00:01:51.774 --> 00:01:55.774
(crowd cheering and applauding)

41
00:01:57.488 --> 00:01:59.316
These guys could do that!

42
00:01:59.316 --> 00:02:03.316
