45
00:02:06.266 --> 00:02:07.470
La la.

46
00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:09.470
Ba ba ba ba, ba ba ba.

47
00:02:10.445 --> 00:02:12.753
(crowd singing along)

48
00:02:12.753 --> 00:02:15.003
(laughing)

49
00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:19.475
[Conan] La la la.

50
00:02:19.475 --> 00:02:20.807
Very good!

51
